(property "Datasheet" "Adafruit official Eagle PS0 net has factory 10k pulldown. External 1k pullup overrides it at reset; Zero GP8 sinks about3.3mA during wake." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
(property "Description" " | design | Do not fit10k here: together with the factory10k pulldown it would produce half-rail and invalid SPI strap. 1k gives about3.0V high at3.3V supply, then GP8 drives the wake pulse low." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
